Package: fplida
Title: Synthetic Data Generation for PLIDA and BLADE
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R:
    person("Will", "Mackey", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "will.mackey@anu.edu.au")
Description: Generate synthetic datasets that mirror the structure of the
    Australian Person Level Integrated Data Asset (PLIDA) and the Business
    Longitudinal Analysis Data Environment (BLADE). The package projects
    administrative, Census, and survey products from shared synthetic person
    and business spines. Shared attributes support consistency across related
    products. R and Rust components provide Parquet and CSV output for small
    exercises and large-scale method tests. The package contains public
    metadata and synthetic output only. It contains no confidential PLIDA or
    BLADE data. The structural metadata is based on data item lists published
    by the Australian Bureau of Statistics.
